{"id":1011478,"slug":"dokonal-spiderman-vs-the-sinister-6-2016","title":"Dokonalý Spiderman- vs. The Sinister 6","title_en":null,"year":2016,"rating":75,"votes_count":43,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"série","vod_date":null,"plot":null,"poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/170/116/170116539_tvfw01.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Animovaný","Akční","Dobrodružný","Sci-Fi"],"tags":[],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Alex Soto","Jae Woo Kim","Roy Burdine","Young Ki Yoon"],"actors":["Drake Bell","Eric Bauza","Mark Hamill","Tom Kenny","Matt Lanter","Misty Lee","Chi McBride","Logan Miller","Scott Porter","Diedrich Bader","Steven Weber","Ogie Banks","Maria Canals-Barrera","Danny Jacobs","Liam O'Brien","Rob Paulsen","Dee Bradley Baker","Greg Cipes","Iain De Caestecker","Elizabeth Henstridge","Phil LaMarr","Daryl Sabara","James Arnold Taylor","Ashley Eckstein","Rose McGowan","Cree Summer","Fred Tatasciore","Tara Strong","Roger Craig Smith","Stan Lee","Christopher Daniel Barnes","Troy Baker","Clancy Brown","Trevor Devall","Will Friedle","Seth Green","Kevin Michael Richardson","Jon Polito","Milo Ventimiglia","Keone Young","Dove Cameron","Robert Clotworthy","Paul Scheer","Mary Kate Wiles","Caitlyn Taylor Love","Adrian Pasdar","Facundo Reyes","Ben Diskin","Imari Williams","Grant George"],"screenwriters":["Kevin Burke","Marty Isenberg","Paul Giacoppo","Andrew Robinson","Chris Wyatt","Jacob Fox","Gavin Hignight","Joshua Fine","Mairghread Scott","Geoffrey Thorne","Matt Wayne","Henry Gilroy","Joshua Hale Fialkov","Elliott Casey"],"cinematographers":[],"composers":["Kevin Manthei"],"reviews":[{"author":"MartinTerran","text":"Podtitul je poněkud zavádějící, jelikož zde sice jde o Sinister 6, ale dokupy vystupují minimálně.Čtvrtá řada se opět povedla, hlášek je tu opět přehršel, akční i napínavé to je stále. Mini série vždy patří k tomu nejlepšímu díky dostatečnému času na příběh a také se vrátil